  "statistical_methodology": {
    "cv_protocol": "StratifiedGroupKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=seed) grouped by family_id, with TF-IDF + balanced LogisticRegression refitted inside every fold. Stratum-controlled probes restrict to shared strata and apply inverse-stratum-count sample weights during fitting.",
